ERROR: the public development HMAC secret (LOCAL_PROOF_SECRET) is refused without explicit development intent (ACTENON_ENV='<unset>'). It is published in the package, so a proof signed with it proves nothing. For local development, demos or tests set ACTENON_ENV=development (or dev, local, test) or use ActenonGate.local_dev(...). In production use asymmetric well-known/KMS/HSM signing custody.
